\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real Opens Weaker, Market Expects  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 November 2012\par 12:41\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Real opened at BRL2.1022 to the dollar, from BRL2.0957\par \par \uc2 --Markets expect \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken real\par \par \uc2 --Real has traded within BRL2.0 to BRL2.1 range for months\par \par \uc2 By Jeffrey T. Lewis\par \par \uc2 BRASILIA--The Brazilian real weakened slightly against the dollar Friday, moving past the implicit BRL2.10 ceiling and sparking expectations the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The real traded at BRL2.1022 to the dollar shortly after the open, according to Tullett Prebon via Factset, from BRL2.0957 at the close of active trading Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The real has been trading between BRL2.0 to BRL2.1 in recent months, kept within that range by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and aggressive comments by Brazilian Finance Minister \uc2 Guido Mantega\uc2  and, occasionally, President Dilma Rousseff.\par \par \uc2 The real has flirted with the BRL2.1 level this week, as markets wait to see when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will act.\par \par \uc2 "The market is calling on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ; we're going to see if the bank will come in," said Sidnei Nehme, director at the NGO brokerage in Sao Paulo.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had weakened to BRL2.0971 to the dollar in intraday trading before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  issued a statement announcing minor changes in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction mechanism.\par \par \uc2 The move was interpreted by some as a warning to traders that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would resume activity.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jeffrey T. Lewis at jeffrey.lewis@dowjones.com [ 23-11-12 1141GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020121123e8bn000g3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
