\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real weakens further,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  eyed\b0\par\par\uc2 By Walter Brandimarte   \par \uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 November 2012\par 12:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO, Nov 21 (Reuters) - The Brazilian real opened weaker as global risk aversion grew on Wednesday, with investors likely to test the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's willingness to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to halt the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's depreciation.\par \par \uc2 The real weakened 0.6 percent to 2.0927 per dollar, nearing the ceiling of a narrow trading range of 2.0-2.1 per greenback set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  since July.\par \par \uc2 "Our view is unchanged: we still see the real to test the 2.10 (level) soon," \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  strategists wrote in a research note.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian policymakers have favored a real weaker than 2 per dollar in order to support the country's industry. At the same time, a much weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could further spur inflation, which is already running above the center of a government target range.\par \par \uc2 In the past several months, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has resorted to a series of traditional and reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap auctions -- which emulate, respectively, the sale and the purchase of dollars in the futures market -- to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the 2.0-2.1 reais per dollar range.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting By Walter Brandimarte Editing by W Simon)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-BRAZIL/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | U | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020121124e8bl0004z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
