\par\par \b \uc2 Weaker Brazilian Real Likely Here to Stay - Stuhlberger\b0\par\par\uc2 By Erin McCarthy   \par \uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 November 2012\par 18:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 Current weaker levels for the Brazilian real are likely here to stay, given the reduction of short-term interest rates in Brazil, Luis Stuhlberger, co-founder and chief investment officer of one of Brazil's largest asset managers, \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2  Hedging-Griffo, said Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real has been trading in a range of BRL2 to BRL2.10 per dollar in recent months, kept in line by the threat of periodic \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and comments by \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's finance minister.\par \par \uc2 But the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely can depreciate without the help of the government, Mr. Stuhlberger said, while speaking at a New York event organized by the Brazilian-American Chamber of Commerce.\par \par \uc2 The dollar likely won't fall below BRL2 again "in our lifetime," he said.\par \par \uc2 In fact, the Brazilian government actually could reduce or remove the current 6% financial \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  tax intended to prevent excessive real strength, as a way to test the markets, he said.\par \par \uc2 The main reason that the real is likely to see future weakness is the shift lower in real interest rates, he said. \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has slashed its benchmark Selic rate to a historic low of 7.25%, from as high at 12.50 in mid-2011.\par \par \uc2 He largely disagrees with market analysts who say the real could return to trading at BRL1.90 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Write to Erin McCarthy at erin.mccarthy@dowjones.com [ 20-11-12 1716GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020121120e8bk000yh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
