\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Stronger Early as Market Tracks Inflation, Inflows\b0\par\par\uc2 By Gerald Jeffris   \par \uc2 326 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 November 2012\par 13:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BRASILIA--Brazil's real strengthened slightly in early trading Wednesday as investors gauged prospects for dollar inflows amid signs of continued firm inflation locally.\par \par \uc2 As of 6:50 a.m. EST, the real traded at BRL2.0304 to the dollar after ending at BRL2.0318 to the dollar Tuesday, according to Tullett Prebon via Factset.\par \par \uc2 Traders noted fresh inflation data was grabbing the focus in early market action Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's IBGE statistics institute reported the IPCA consumer price index accelerated 0.59% in October after a 0.57% advance in September. The October figure was the highest since April, and brought 12-month inflation to 5.45% from 5.28% through September.\par \par \uc2 The latest result helped bring expectations of more inflows alongside the view the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should stabilize interest rates as it pursues an annual inflation target of 4.5%. The bank has cut its benchmark Selic rate by more than 5 percentage points over the past year to a current 7.25%.\par \par \uc2 Traders said events abroad also reinforced as the re-election of U.S. President Barack Obama signaled the possible extension of monetary easing in the U.S.\par \par \uc2 That, and continued tough conditions in Europe are seen possibly encouraging more inflows to emerging markets such as Brazil.\par \par \uc2 "There's already a clearer vision for 2013 with perspectives for a slow recovery from the international crisis, and risks of deterioration before improvements come," said analysts Sidnei Nehme at the NGO brokerage in Sao Paulo.\par \par \uc2 Local officials, meanwhile, appear determined to curb heavy inflows with a "dirty float" of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that should involve further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the government and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  if \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real moves far outside a narrow band maintained over recent months just above BRL2.00 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Write to Gerald Jeffris at gerald.jeffris@dowjones.com [ 07-11-12 1206GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020121107e8b7000zc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
