\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Brazil cenbank acts to keep real above 2/dlr\b0\par\par\uc2 320 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Oktober 2012\par 14:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Cenbank sells 33,000 swaps to roll over expiring contracts\par \par \uc2 * Bank rolls over about half of contracts, could act again\par \par \uc2 * Real weakens 0.17 pct after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 (Adds quote from analyst, background)\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Oct 23 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday to prevent the real from gaining past 2 per dollar, a level policymakers consider beneficial for stimulating exports.\par \par \uc2 The bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  after a series of small gains led the real to close on Monday at 2.0244 per dollar, its strongest level since Oct. 4.\par \par \uc2 Appreciation by the real then prompted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's last market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on Oct. 5.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  just said 'good morning' to the market. It wants to make it clear that there will be no room for players to make the real even stronger," said Sidnei Nehme, executive director at NGO brokerage in Sao Paulo.\par \par \uc2 The real weakened 0.17 percent after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action, to 2.0279 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps, derivative contracts that emulate the purchase of dollars in the futures market. But the sale, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said, was merely intended to roll over similar contracts that expire on Nov. 1.\par \par \uc2 Traders speculated that the bank could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again because it only sold a little more than half of the 60,000 contracts it offered in an auction -- not enough to roll over all the 59,800 reverse swaps that expire next week.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold 17,000 swaps maturing on Dec. 3, 2012, and 16,000 contracts maturing Jan. 2, 2013, it said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Silvio Cascione and Natalia Cacioli, writing by Walter Brandimarte)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-BRAZIL/SWAP (UPDATE 1) | ABN | D | E | RBN | M | NAT | U | C | O | MTL | GRO | SOF | OIL | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020121023e8an000rq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
