\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Real Ends Firmer as Market Waits for More  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Gerald Jeffris   \par \uc2 363 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Oktober 2012\par 20:52\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BRASILIA--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real reversed early Monday, weakening to drift stronger through the end of the session as investors positioned for more possible \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in coming sessions.\par \par \uc2 The real exited regular trading at BRL2.0235 to the dollar after ending at BRL2.0262 to the dollar Friday, according to Tullett Prebon via Factset.\par \par \uc2 Traders noted the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  began the session weaker as factors abroad weighed in against key commodities prices and dollar inflows locally. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  floated back later in the session alongside a strengthening euro and recovery in some key asset prices.\par \par \uc2 But analysts noted that investors remained positioned for possible further moves by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid recent affirmations by the government that it would continue to defend a weakened local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "On the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  front, the authorities remain committed through heavy open-ended \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and unambiguous rhetoric to keeping, at least for the time being, the BRL/USD trading pegged above the implicit 2.00 threshold," said \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  analyst Alberto Ramos.\par \par \uc2 On the horizon for the local market is the possible rollover of some $3 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps at the beginning of next month aimed at maintaining the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  within a stable range.\par \par \uc2 The government, in the meantime, appears to be in a difficult position, weighing the positive impact of local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation on accelerated local inflation with the need to maintain a weaker real to stimulate Brazilian economic activity in a sluggish global environment.\par \par \uc2 But given recent hints that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been biased toward offering stimulus for the economy, market players Monday speculated the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  may soon take action to push the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken further to a band between BRL2.05 to BRL2.10 to the dollar before allowing it to strengthen again at a later date.\par \par \uc2 According to the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  market survey released Monday, the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is seen ending 2012 at around BRL2.01 to the dollar and remaining around that level through the end of 2013.\par \par \uc2 Write to Gerald Jeffris at gerald.jeffris@dowjones.com [ 22-10-12 1852GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020121022e8am000y6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw181\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2715\pichgoal600
