\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's Meirelles Sees Less Impact from QE3 on Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 September 2012\par 16:42\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global FX & Fixed Income News\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--The former president of the \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Henrique Meirelles\uc2 , said Tuesday that he sees less of an impact on emerging-market countries such as Brazil from the U.S. Federal Reserve's latest round of monetary stimulus than in the past.\par \par \uc2 "In my estimation, it's possible that the marginal impact of this will be a bit less than previously," Mr. Meirelles told Dow Jones on the sidelines of an event, referring to the effect on Brazil.\par \par \uc2 The Fed earlier this month announced a third round of asset purchases known as quantitative easing. Previous such measures have been blamed by Brazilian authorities for appreciation in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar, putting local businesses at a disadvantage to their international competitors.\par \par \uc2 In the wake of the latest round of quantitative easing, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market to weaken the real while Finance Minister \uc2 Guido Mantega\uc2  and other officials have warned that they'll "defend" the Brazilian real from appreciation.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Meirelles said that "each stimulus measure in each country generates collateral effects."\par \par \uc2 But he added that there's "a less accentuated contrast" between economic growth in emerging markets and developed countries than when the first and second rounds of quantitative easing were launched.\par \par \uc2 "The U.S. economy is a bit better, the actions of the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  have also reduced the level of uncertainty," Mr. Meirelles said. "There's an environment that's a little more balanced."\par \par \uc2 Write to Paul Kiernan at\par \par \uc2 paul.kiernan@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Subscribe to WSJ: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires }}}\uc2  [ 09-25-12 1121ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020120925e89p0003g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
