\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's Real Closes Stronger, Extends Gains on Fed QE3 Announcement\b0\par\par\uc2 337 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2012\par 21:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Real strengthened to BRL2.0105 from BRL2.0192 Thursday\par \par \uc2 --Fed QE3 announcement caused flow of dollars to emerging markets\par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  auctions slowed appreciation\par \par \uc2 By Jeffrey T. Lewis\par \par \uc2 BRASILIA (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real strengthened against the dollar Friday for the second day after the U.S. Federal Reserve Bank announced a program to buy assets to boost the U.S. economy.\par \par \uc2 The real exited active trading at BRL2.0105 to the dollar, from Thursday's close of BRL2.0192. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthened even after two reverse swap auctions held by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the real from gaining too much against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 "We're seeing an arm-wrestling match between the market and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Luiz Antonio Abdo, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  director at the \uc2 Souza Barros\uc2  brokerage in Sao Paulo. "The market is betting that the Fed measures will cause a flow of dollars into emerging markets, but I don't think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will let it get below BRL2.00. They have plenty of tools they can use" to keep in the range they want.\par \par \uc2 The Fed said Thursday it would buy $40 billion of mortgage-backed securities every month until the labor market improves. The rate-setting Federal Open Market Committee, or FOMC, also said it plans to keep its federal-funds rate near zero though at least mid-2015.\par \par \uc2 The announcement cheered equity markets and weakened the dollar against many world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will remain ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the real from strengthening too far or too fast against the dollar should the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthen closer to the 2.01 level, said Luiz Carlos Baldan, director of the Fourtrade brokerage in Sao Paulo.\par \par \uc2 "They want the real between BRL2.0 and BRL2.05 to the dollar, so the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will step in" if necessary, he said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jeffrey T. Lewis at jeffrey.lewis@dowjones.com [ 14-09-12 1937GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120914e89e000yg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
